                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I do IT professionally for a living, and I've been building my own computers since I was a kid, so when this game appeared on Steam I instantly took a shine to it. The developer is a great guy who is building this game by himself, yet he manages to put out updates all the time, with both content and bug fixes. He listens to feedback, and often will add features we request into the game soon after we ask. Same goes for any fixes we think could be made; if he becomes aware of something that needs fixing, don't expect it to be broken for long. He has a clear path for improving the game and adding content, with no slowdown in sight. True, it could use more content. But this is a unique little gem that doesn't break the bank. I am happy to have been able to purchase this and help support a truly helpful, caring developer.",
